<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>And He said to me,</l><l>Son of man, feed your stomach,</l><l>Fill your inward parts</l><l>With this scroll,</l><l>And go! Go speak</l><l>To the house of Israel.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
